              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-section">
              <div class="form-section-title">偏好与禁区</div>
              <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-label">投资偏好</div>
                <div>
                  <textarea class="textarea" rows="2">偏好长期稳健 · 排除高杠杆 · 不参与单一资产 &gt; 30% 集中度</textarea>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-label">行业排除</div>
                <div>
                  <div class="flex gap-2" style="flex-wrap: wrap;">
                    <span class="badge badge-danger" style="cursor: pointer;">赌博 / 博彩 ×</span>
